    <item>
      <title>Did God Fail to Erase Them?</title>
      <description><![CDATA[Let's investigate the giants hidden in the pages of Genesis.<br/><br/>Before the Great Flood, a forbidden union created a race of giants. Their existence was so terrible, it forced God to reset the world.<br/><br/>A single verse in Genesis speaks of 'giants' who walked the Earth, born from a forbidden union between heavenly beings and human women. The original Hebrew calls them the Nephilim. Their existence was so corrupting that it triggered the Great Flood, God's attempt to wipe the slate clean. But did He succeed? This is the story of the beings that nearly ended humanity.<br/><br/>If you enjoy exploring the lesser-known side of the Bible, subscribe and hit the bell. New episodes every Tuesday and Sunday.<br/><br/><br/><br/> #nephilim #genesis #biblemysteries #angelology #featherStoriesGroup]]></description>
